(28, 1, 1, '', '<p>Size: Dia 18 cm x H 15 cm, Dia 24.5 cm x H 21 cm</p>\n<p>Number of Head: 1 Head, 2 Heads, 3 Heads, 4 Heads, 5 Heads, 6 Heads, 7 Heads, 8 Heads, 9 Heads, 10 Heads</p>\n<p>Color<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>: Black, White</p>\n<p>Room: Dining Room, Living Room</p>\n<p>Material: Acrylic, Aluminum</p>\n<p>Aim pendant light Product Size</p>\n<p>Size A: Dia 18 cm x H 15 cm/ Φ 7″ x H 5.9″</p>\n<p>Size B: Dia 24.5 cm x H 21 cm/ ∅ 10″ x H 8.3″</p>', 'aim-pendant-light', '', '', '', 'Aim Pendant Light', '', '', '', ''),
(29, 1, 1, '', '<p>Weight:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>9 kg</p>\n<p>Dimensions:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>1 × 1 × 1 cm</p>\n<p>Number of Bulbs:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>12 Heads, 16 Heads A 60 cm, 16 Heads B 80 cm, 8 Heads, 9 Heads</p>\n<p>Body Color:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>Gold, Silver</p>\n<p>Color<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>:Clear: Gold, Silver</p>\n<p>Room:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>Bedroom, Dining Room, Kitchen, Living Room</p>\n<p>Material:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>Crystal, Metal</p>', 'modern-dandelion-crystal-chandelier', '', '', '', 'Modern dandelion Crystal Chandelier', '', '', '', ''),
(30, 1, 1, '<p>Weight: 12 kg</p>\n<p>Dimensions: 65 × 65 × 45 cm</p>\n<p>Size:<span style=\"white-space:pre;\"> </span>1 light, 2 lights, 3 lights-round plate, 3 lights-rectangular plate, 4 lights-round plate</p>\n<p>Lamp Type: Aluminum pendant light</p>\n<p>Warranty: 2 year</p>\n<p>Power Source: AC</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Installation Type: Flush Mount</p>\n<p>Switch Type: Knob switch</p>\n<p>Item Type: Chandeliers</p>\n<p>Light Source: LED Bulbs</p>\n<p>Model Number: opkmb0819</p>\n<p>Base Type: G9</p>\n<p>Shade Direction: Down</p>\n<p>Finish: Polished Chrome</p>\n<p>Color: Chrome, Gold</p>\n<p>Room: Bedroom, Dining Room, Guest Room</p>\n<p>Style: Modern &amp; Contemporary</p>', '<p>Shiny Hand-Made Stainless Steel Leaf Chandelier makes your mood good. When hung in the air, it brings dots of stars, like sparkling pearls in the sky. Available in five sizes and two colors.</p>', 'hand-made-stainless-steel-leaf-chandelier', '', '', '', 'Hand-Made Stainless Steel Leaf Chandelier', '', '', '', ''),
(31, 1, 1, '<p>Size: 15 Heads: Dia 92 cm x H 56 cm, 3 Heads: Dia 51 cm x H 45 cm, 6 Heads: Dia 65 cm x H 52 cm, 8 Heads: Dia 75 cm x H 55 cm</p>\n<p>Color: Black, Clear, White</p>\n<p>Material: Crystal, Metal</p>\n<p>Room: Bedroom, Dining Room, Living Room</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Candlestick Crystal Chandelier  Product Size</strong></p>\n<p>3 Heads: Dia 51 x H 45 cm/ ∅ 30″ x H 17.7″</p>\n<p>6 Heads: Dia 65 x H 52 cm/ ∅ 25.5″ x H 20.5″</p>\n<p>8 Heads: Dia 75 x H 55 cm/ ∅ 29.5″ x H 21.7″</p>\n<p>15 Heads: Dia 92 x H 56 cm/ ∅ 36.2″ x H 22″</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Candlestick Crystal Chandelier Product Details</strong></p>\n<p>Material: Metal/ K 9 Crystal</p>\n<p>Light source: E 14</p>\n<p>Power: Max 40 W</p>\n<p>Weight: 10 kg/22 lbs</p>\n<p>Finishes: White/ Clear</p>\n<p>Process: Die Casting/ Paint</p>\n<p>Control method: push button switch (not dimmable)</p>\n<p>We provide 60 cm/23.6″ wires can be extended upon request.</p>', '<p>Candlestick crystal chandelier is a modern luxurious chandelier which displays the view that light reflect through the crystal and forming a “shiny diamond”. Available in four different sizes.</p>', 'candlestick-crystal-chandelier', '', '', '', 'Candlestick Crystal Chandelier', '', '', '', ''),
(32, 1, 1, '<p>Size: 3 heads: Dia 58cm x H 60cm, 6 heads: Dia 65cm x H 60cm</p>\n<p>Color: Champagne gold</p>\n<p>Material: Metal</p>\n<p>Room: Dining Room, Living Room</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Romantic Candle Chandelier Product Size</strong></p>\n<p>3 heads: Dia 58cm x H 60cm/ Φ 22,8″ x H 23,6″</p>\n<p>6 heads: Dia 65cm x H 60cm/ Φ 25,6″ x H 23,6″</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Romantic Candle Chandelier Details</strong></p>\n<p>Material: Metal</p>\n<p>Light source: E14</p>\n<p>Power: Max 40W</p>\n<p>Weight: 3 kg/ 6.6 lbs</p>\n<p>Finishes: Champagne gold</p>\n<p>Process: Die Casting/ Paint</p>\n<p>Control method: push button switch (not dimmable)</p>\n<p>We provide 100 cm/ 39″ wires which can be extended upon request.</p>', '<p>The French Romantic Candle Chandelier is full of the elegance of classical culture and the Renaissance poetry. It uses lines to modernize its design. With warm light, it will be a charming chandelier for living rooms.</p>', 'romantic-candle-chandelier', '', '', '', 'Romantic Candle Chandelier', '', '', '', ''),
(33, 1, 1, '', '<p>Retro Rust Iron Cage chandelier is just irresistible. The candle holder is made of iron with a rustic style and decorated with luxurious crystal.  It will create a nostalgic atmosphere. But don’t forget to light up the candles!</p>', 'retro-rust-iron-cage-chandelier', '', '', '', 'Retro Rust Iron Cage chandelier', '', '', '', ''),
